        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Acute febrile illness plus laboratory confirmation of Lassa virus infection",
    "notes": "Early diagnosis is critical due to high mortality and need for antiviral therapy"
